    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All global functionality for the <ref refid="class_u_weapon_system" kindref="compound">UWeaponSystem</ref>, comparable to the UItemSystem. Unlikely the UItemSystem, most of the <ref refid="class_u_weapon_system" kindref="compound">UWeaponSystem</ref>&apos;s struct accessing can just be done directly. That&apos;s because this system is generally only used by a few classes.. If we change a member variable, it&apos;s just 5-10 minutes of a couple files to change everything else to match. These are for more in depth inconvenient things like calling data rows from data tables and validating weapon data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
